              "text": "सोनेरी (sonerī) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from suvarṇadhara, \"containing gold\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 13522). It is built on suvarṇa, \"gold\"."
